<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>Krishna Wisdom Contest 2026</title>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <style>
    *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a237e 0%,#0d47a1 55%,#01579b 100%);
      color:#fff;
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }

    body::before{
      content:'';
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 35%, rgba(255,215,0,.10) 0%, transparent 42%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 75%, rgba(255,193,7,.08) 0%, transparent 44%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 45% 90%, rgba(255,255,255,.05) 0%, transparent 34%);
      pointer-events:none;
      z-index:0;
    }

    .navbar{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:1000;
      background:rgba(21,32,66,.94);
      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
      box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
      padding:15px 0;
    }

    .navbar-content{
      max-width:1200px;
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:0 20px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .brand-title{
      font-size:24px;
      font-weight:800;
      text-align:center;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700 0%,#ffb300 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip:text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
      background-clip:text;
      letter-spacing:.2px;
    }

    .hero{
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
      max-width:1150px;
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:68px 20px 42px;
      text-align:center;
    }

    .hero h1{
      font-size:56px;
      line-height:1.1;
      margin-bottom:18px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700 0%,#fff 55%,#ffd700 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip:text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
      background-clip:text;
    }

    .hero p{
      font-size:24px;
      color:#e8f1ff;
      margin-bottom:10px;
      font-weight:400;
    }

    .hero-subtitle{
      max-width:920px;
      margin:0 auto 28px;
      font-size:18px;
      line-height:1.7;
      color:#ffe082;
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      align-items:center;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      min-width:185px;
      padding:16px 30px;
      border-radius:34px;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-size:17px;
      font-weight:800;
      transition:.28s ease;
      border:none;
      cursor:pointer;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .btn-primary{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700 0%,#ffb300 100%);
      color:#1a237e;
      box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(255,215,0,.42);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover{
      transform:translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(255,215,0,.56);
    }
.hero-subtitle{
  max-width:980px;
  margin:0 auto 28px;
  font-size:18px;
  line-height:1.8;
  color:#ffe082;
}

.hero-subtitle strong{
  color:#fff3b0;
}
    .btn-secondary{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      color:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover{
      transform:translateY(-3px);
      border-color:rgba(255,215,0,.45);
      color:#ffd700;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    }

    .btn-ghost{
      background:transparent;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,.35);
      color:#ffe082;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover{
      transform:translateY(-3px);
      background:rgba(255,215,0,.08);
      border-color:#ffd700;
    }

    .section{
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
      max-width:1280px;
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:34px 20px;
    }

    .section h2{
      text-align:center;
      font-size:42px;
      color:#ffd700;
      margin-bottom:12px;
      text-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(255,215,0,.16);
    }

    .section-subtitle{
      text-align:center;
      max-width:900px;
      margin:0 auto 28px;
      color:#e3f2fd;
      font-size:18px;
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .contests-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));
      gap:24px;
    }

    .contest-card{
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.08),rgba(255,255,255,.025));
      backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
      border:2px solid rgba(255,215,0,.24);
      border-radius:24px;
      padding:22px;
      box-shadow:0 10px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.22);
      transition:.3s ease;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .contest-card:hover{
      transform:translateY(-8px);
      border-color:#ffd700;
      box-shadow:0 16px 42px rgba(255,215,0,.20);
    }

 .contest-image-wrap{
  width:100%;
  height:250px;
  border-radius:18px;
  overflow:hidden;
  margin-bottom:18px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7d6,#f3e5ab);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,.35);
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:10px;
}

.contest-image{
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  object-fit:contain;
  object-position:center;
  display:block;
  border-radius:14px;
}


    .contest-image-fallback{
      font-size:54px;
      color:#8d6e00;
    }

    .contest-card h3{
      color:#ffd700;
      text-align:center;
      font-size:26px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
      line-height:1.3;
    }

    .contest-card p{
      color:#edf4ff;
      text-align:center;
      line-height:1.7;
      font-size:15.5px;
      margin-bottom:16px;
    }

    .info-block,
    .prizes-section,
    .benefits-section,
    .rules-section{
      background:rgba(0,0,0,.16);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,.14);
      border-radius:16px;
      padding:16px;
      margin-top:14px;
    }

    .info-row{
      color:#e8f1ff;
      font-size:14.5px;
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .info-row + .info-row{margin-top:7px}

    .block-title{
      color:#ffd700;
      font-size:18px;
      font-weight:800;
      text-align:center;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .prize-lines{
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:8px;
    }

    .prize-line{
      color:#fff3cd;
      line-height:1.6;
      font-size:15px;
      text-align:left;
    }

    .benefits-section ul,
    .rules-section ul{
      padding-left:18px;
      color:#e8f1ff;
      line-height:1.75;
      font-size:15px;
    }

    .benefits-section li + li,
    .rules-section li + li{
      margin-top:5px;
    }

    .participate-btn{
      display:block;
      width:100%;
      margin-top:18px;
      padding:15px;
      border-radius:30px;
      text-align:center;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-size:17px;
      font-weight:800;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700 0%,#ffb300 100%);
      color:#1a237e;
      box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(255,215,0,.35);
      transition:.28s ease;
    }

    .participate-btn:hover{
      transform:translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(255,215,0,.48);
    }

    .story-wrap{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
      gap:24px;
      align-items:stretch;
    }

    .story-card,
    .about-section{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,.16);
      border-radius:24px;
      padding:28px 26px;
      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
      box-shadow:0 10px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
    }

    .story-card h3,
    .about-section h3{
      color:#ffd700;
      font-size:30px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .story-card p,
    .about-section p{
      color:#eaf3ff;
      line-height:1.8;
      font-size:16.5px;
    }

    .story-highlights{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
      gap:14px;
      margin-top:18px;
    }

    .highlight-box{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,.15);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:18px 14px;
      text-align:center;
    }

    .highlight-box strong{
      display:block;
      font-size:28px;
      color:#ffd700;
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }

    .highlight-box span{
      color:#eaf3ff;
      font-size:14px;
      line-height:1.5;
    }

    .winners-mini{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:12px;
    }

    .winner-mini-card{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,248,220,.92),rgba(255,255,255,.85));
      color:#2a2a2a;
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:16px;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,183,0,.45);
      box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
    }

    .winner-rank{
      display:inline-block;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4c430,#d4a514);
      color:#2c1f00;
      font-weight:800;
      font-size:13px;
      padding:7px 14px;
      border-radius:999px;
      margin-bottom:10px;
    }

    .winner-name{
      font-size:22px;
      font-weight:800;
      margin-bottom:6px;
      color:#2a2a2a;
    }

    .winner-place{
      font-size:14px;
      color:#666;
      margin-bottom:8px;
      line-height:1.5;
    }

    .winner-prize{
      font-size:18px;
      font-weight:800;
      color:#b8860b;
    }

    .about-section{
      margin-top:8px;
    }

    .footer{
      background:rgba(13,19,38,.95);
      padding:34px 20px 22px;
      margin-top:28px;
      text-align:center;
      border-top:2px solid rgba(255,215,0,.16);
    }

    .footer-content{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}

    .footer p{
      margin:10px 0;
      color:#b0bec5;
      font-size:15px;
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    .footer a{
      color:#ffd700;
      text-decoration:none;
      padding:4px 8px;
      border-radius:5px;
      transition:.25s ease;
    }

    .footer a:hover{
      color:#fff;
      background:rgba(255,215,0,.1);
    }

    .footer-links{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:center;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:10px;
      margin:18px 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 992px){
      .story-wrap{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px){
      .navbar{padding:14px 0}
      .brand-title{font-size:21px}
      .hero{padding:52px 16px 34px}
      .hero h1{font-size:36px}
      .hero p{font-size:19px}
      .hero-subtitle{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:22px}
      .hero-actions{gap:10px}
      .btn{width:100%;max-width:320px}
      .section{padding:28px 16px}
      .section h2{font-size:31px}
      .section-subtitle{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:22px}
      .contests-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}
      .story-highlights{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .story-card,.about-section{padding:22px 18px}
      .story-card h3,.about-section h3{font-size:25px}
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px){
      .brand-title{font-size:19px}
      .hero h1{font-size:29px}
      .hero p{font-size:17px}
      .section h2{font-size:27px}
      .contest-card h3{font-size:23px}
      .winner-name{font-size:20px}
    }

@media (min-width: 769px){
  .contest-image-wrap{
    height:270px;
  }
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="navbar-content">
      <div class="brand-title">Krishna Wisdom Contest 2026</div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
  <h1>Krishna Wisdom Contest 2026</h1>
  <p>Write with devotion. Reflect with wisdom. Express through essays.</p>
  <div class="hero-subtitle">
    Join our essay writing contests inspired by the <strong>Bhagavad Gita</strong>, <strong>Bhagavatam</strong>, <strong>Ramayana</strong>, and <strong>Krishna book wisdom</strong>.
    Choose your category, read deeply, write thoughtfully, and participate in a meaningful spiritual learning journey.
  </div>

  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Register Now</a>
    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-secondary">Login</a>
    <a href="#contests" class="btn btn-ghost">Explore Contests ↓</a>
  </div>
</section>

  <section class="section" id="contests">
    <h2>Essay Writing Contests</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Explore the active contests, view important dates, understand the prizes, and register for the category that matches your age group.
    </p>

    <div class="contests-grid">
      <% contests.forEach((c) => {
        const rawBenefits = Array.isArray(c.participant_benefits) ? [...c.participant_benefits] : [];
        const hasCertificate = rawBenefits.some(b => String(b || '').toLowerCase().includes('certificate'));
        if (!hasCertificate) rawBenefits.push('Digital participation certificate');

        const prizeLines = String(c.prize_details || '')
          .split(/\r?\n|\|/g)
          .map(s => String(s || '').trim())
          .filter(Boolean);

        const enhancedPrizeLines = prizeLines.length
          ? prizeLines.map((line) => {
              const t = line.toLowerCase();
              if (t.includes('1st')) return line + ' 🥇';
              if (t.includes('2nd')) return line + ' 🥈';
              if (t.includes('3rd')) return line + ' 🥉';
              if (t.includes('darshan')) return line + ' 🙏';
              return line + ' ✨';
            })
          : ['1st Prize – Special award 🥇', '2nd Prize – Special award 🥈', '3rd Prize – Special award 🥉'];
      %>
        <div class="contest-card">
          <div class="contest-image-wrap">
            <% if (c.image_url) { %>
              <img
                src="<%= c.image_url %>"
                alt="<%= c.title %>"
                class="contest-image"
                loading="lazy"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
              />
              <div class="contest-image-fallback" style="display:none;">📘</div>
            <% } else { %>
              <div class="contest-image-fallback">📘</div>
            <% } %>
          </div>

          <h3><%= c.title %></h3>
          <p><%= c.description %></p>

          <div class="info-block">
  <div class="info-row">
    <strong>Age Categories:</strong>
    <%= Array.isArray(c.age_categories) ? c.age_categories.join(', ') : '-' %>
  </div>

  <div class="info-row">
    <strong>Contest Period:</strong>
    27/03/2026 to 04/09/2026
  </div>

  <div class="info-row">
    <strong>Submit your essay before:</strong>
    04/09/2026
  </div>

  <div class="info-row">
    <strong>Results / Winners Announcement:</strong>
    <%= c.winner_declaration_date ? new Date(c.winner_declaration_date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB') : '-' %>
  </div>
</div>
          <div class="prizes-section">
            <div class="block-title">🏅 Prize Details</div>
            <div class="prize-lines">
              <% enhancedPrizeLines.forEach((line) => { %>
                <div class="prize-line">• <%= line %></div>
              <% }) %>
            </div>
          </div>

          <% if (rawBenefits.length) { %>
            <div class="benefits-section">
              <div class="block-title">🎁 Participant Benefits</div>
              <ul>
                <% rawBenefits.forEach((b) => { %>
                  <li><%= b %></li>
                <% }) %>
              </ul>
            </div>
          <% } %>

          <% if (Array.isArray(c.rules) && c.rules.length) { %>
            <div class="rules-section">
              <div class="block-title">📜 Rules & Guidelines</div>
              <ul>
                <% c.rules.forEach((r) => { %>
                  <li><%= r %></li>
                <% }) %>
              </ul>
            </div>
          <% } %>

          <a href="/register" class="participate-btn">Register for This Contest →</a>
        </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
  <div class="story-wrap">
    <div class="story-card">
      <h3>Previous Successful Event — Value Based Bhagavad Gita Contest</h3>
      <p style="color:#ffe082;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px;">
        Conducted from 01/12/2025 to 15/01/2026
      </p>
      <p>
        Before the Krishna Wisdom Contest 2026, ISKCON Tirupati successfully conducted the
        <strong>Value Based Bhagavad Gita Contest</strong>, a spiritual learning event that received an inspiring response from around
        <strong>25,000 participants</strong>.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:12px;">
        Every registered participant received a <strong>Bhagavad Gita book</strong>, studied the teachings sincerely,
        and took part in a structured quiz by submitting their answers. The event beautifully combined
        reading, reflection, participation, and recognition.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:12px;">
        The success of that previous contest has now inspired the launch of the
        <strong>Krishna Wisdom Contest 2026</strong>, where essay writing becomes a deeper medium for expression,
        understanding, and devotion.
      </p>

      <div class="story-highlights">
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <strong>25,000+</strong>
          <span>participants joined the previous contest enthusiastically.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <strong>1 Book Each</strong>
          <span>Bhagavad Gita book was given to every registered participant.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <strong>Top 3 Awards</strong>
          <span>cash prizes were awarded to the leading performers.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="winners-mini">
      <div class="winner-mini-card">
        <div class="winner-rank">🏆 1st Place</div>
        <div class="winner-name">Venkatesh Reddy Singireddy</div>
        <div class="winner-place">📍 Siddipet, Telangana</div>
        <div class="winner-prize">₹3,50,000</div>
      </div>

      <div class="winner-mini-card">
        <div class="winner-rank">🥈 2nd Place</div>
        <div class="winner-name">P Kiranmai</div>
        <div class="winner-place">📍 Balijagadda, Tirupati, Andhra Pradesh</div>
        <div class="winner-prize">₹2,50,000</div>
      </div>

      <div class="winner-mini-card">
        <div class="winner-rank">🥉 3rd Place</div>
        <div class="winner-name">Rani Durgamba</div>
        <div class="winner-place">📍 Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh</div>
        <div class="winner-prize">₹1,00,000</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="about-section">
      <h3>About the Organizer — ISKCON Tirupati</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON), Tirupati</strong> is dedicated to spiritual education,
        value-based learning, devotional culture, and the practical application of timeless Vedic wisdom in everyday life.
        Through outreach programs, youth initiatives, educational events, book distribution, cultural festivals, and public
        spiritual engagement, ISKCON Tirupati has been serving society with a focus on character-building and inner growth.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px;">
        The Krishna Wisdom Contest 2026 is designed not merely as a competition, but as an uplifting educational movement.
        It encourages participants to read, think, reflect, and articulate spiritual wisdom through essay writing. By combining
        learning, inspiration, and recognition, the contest aims to help students and families connect more deeply with the
        teachings of Lord Krishna in an engaging and meaningful format.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-content">
      <p><strong>International Society for Krishna Consciousness (ISKCON), Tirupati</strong></p>
      <p><strong>Registered Address:</strong> Hare Krishna Land, Hare Krishna Road, Vinayaka Nagar, Tirupati - 517501, Andhra Pradesh, India.</p>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@iskconcontest.org">support@iskconcontest.org</a> | <strong>Phone:</strong> +91-9493805059</p>

      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms & Conditions</a>
        <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:18px;color:#78909c;">© 2026 Krishna Wisdom Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>